  subtitleText_SN: {fileID: 476717769}
  introTextEN: '"Let''s help Dasun! Tap ''Push'' to push the crate away from him.'
  introTextSI: '[Enter Sinhala Intro Here]'
  pushTextEN: Great push! Pushing is a force that moves object away from you. By
    pushing the crate, you moved the crate away from Dasun. Now let's tap 'Pull'!
    to pull it towards Dasun!
  pushTextSI: '[Enter Sinhala Push Here]'
  pullTextEN: Awesome! Pulling is a force that brings an object closer to you. By
    pulling the rope, you brought the crate closer to Dasun!
