    push away!, Use your finger to drag one magnet toward the other. You can use
    flip buttons to change their poles.
  attractSuccessEN: Snap! Great job! The North and South poles are opposites, so
    they attract and pull together.
  repelNNSuccessEN: Whoa, look at them push away! Two North poles are exactly the
    same, so they repel each other.
  repelSSSuccessEN: Did you feel that force? Two South poles are also the same, so
    they repel and push away too!
